# Machine gates (durable CI commands)

CyberOS `.cyberos/gates.env` is not vendored in this checkout (`check-cyberos-install.mjs --if-present` skips). GitHub Actions [`.github/workflows/ci.yml`](../../.github/workflows/ci.yml) is the durable required path:

```
LINT_CMD=npm --prefix app/web run lint
TEST_CMD=npm --prefix app/web test
VERIFY_CMD=npm --prefix app/web run verify
BUILD_CMD=npm --prefix app/web run build
QUALITY_CMD=npm --prefix app/web run quality
```

Mark those workflow jobs required on `main` in GitHub branch protection (operator action; this repository cannot set required checks via read-only `gh`). A red governance commit must not be mergeable.

Commerce freeze (deploy separately): `COMMERCE_MUTATIONS_ENABLED=0` refuses checkout, admin payouts, and WordPress apply. Unset allows mutations so Production stays up until that deploy.
